#: ../source_code.rst:32
msgid "Third-party libraries"
msgstr "Bibliotecas de terceiros"

#: ../source_code.rst:34
msgid ""
"Galette's third-party dependencies are not included in the repository. "
"Instead, PHP dependencies are handled with `Composer dependency manager "
"<https://getcomposer.org>`_ and JavaScript ones with `Node Package Manager "
"(npm) <https://npmjs.com>`_ and `gulp <https://gulpjs.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"As dependências de terceiros do Galette não estão incluídas no repositório. "
"Em vez disso, as dependências do PHP são gerenciadas com o gerenciador de "
"dependências `Composer` (https://getcomposer.org) e as do JavaScript com o "
"Node Package Manager (npm) (https://npmjs.com) e o `gulp` (https://"
"gulpjs.com/)."

